<title>UK: BayerVB sets A$100 million four-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerVB sets A$100 million four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Hambros and BayerVB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    20.FEB.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.55    PAY DATE  L 19.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    LUX	 L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
